  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふるい　ほんで　チヲハウハネとしょうかいされている　せいぶつににたてんが　ある　なぞのポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오래된 책에 “땅을기는날개”라는 이름으로 소개된 생물과 닮은 점이 있는 정체불명의 포켓몬.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與古老書籍裡介紹的一種叫做爬地翅的生物有著相似點的神秘寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon mystérieux présente des similitudes avec Rampe-Ailes, une créature évoquée dans un livre ancien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses rätselhafte Pokémon weist Ähnlichkeit mit einer Kreatur auf, die in einem alten Buch als Kriechflügel vorgestellt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un misterioso Pokémon que presenta ciertas similitudes con Reptalada, una criatura descrita en un tomo antiguo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon enigmatico che ha degli aspetti in comune con una creatura presentata come \"Alirasenti\" in un vecchio libro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This mysterious Pokémon has some similarities to a creature that an old book introduced as Slither Wing.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古い　本で　チヲハウハネと紹介されている　生物に似た点が　ある　謎のポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "这只神秘的宝可梦与古老的书中介绍的名为爬地翅的生物有相似点。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un misterioso Pokémon que presenta ciertas similitudes con Reptalada, una criatura descrita en un tomo antiguo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あやしい　ざっしが　しょうかいしたウルガモスの　たいこの　すがたとじゃっかん　にている　ポケモンだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "괴상한 잡지에서 소개했던 불카모스의 태곳적 모습과 약간 비슷하게 생긴 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與可疑的雜誌介紹的火神蛾太古時代的樣子長得有點像的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble vaguement à une forme de Pyrax très ancienne évoquée dans une revue douteuse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon hat eine gewisse Ähnlichkeit mit einer uralten Form von Ramoth, die in einer fragwürdigen Zeitschrift vorgestellt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda un ligero parecido con un supuesto antepasado de Volcarona publicado en cierta revista de dudosa veracidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha una leggera somiglianza con un’antichissima forma di Volcarona presentata in una rivista di dubbia attendibilità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
